description=Two things that both say raid. BASE RAIDS: a zombie assault on every online player's own safehouse, armed by staff from the menu or landing on its own schedule at night. RAID PROTECTION: a safehouse is lootable by outsiders only while somebody who lives there is online, with a grace period so logging out is not an escape - members and owners can always loot their own base. Settings in Admin Panel - Sandbox Options - Wabbajack Raids.
